{"seq":76,"slug":"go-concurrency-runtime-patterns","title":"Go 并发模式","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns","rating":{"composite":4.19,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# Go 并发模式\n\nGo 的并发哲学建立在 CSP（Communicating Sequential Processes）之上——通过通信共享内存，而非通过共享内存通信。goroutine 与 channel 构成了 Go 并发编程的原子单元，但仅有原语远远不够：在生产系统中，开发者需要掌握一整套经过实战检验的模式，才能写出既高效又不泄漏的并发代码。\n\n本 hub 聚焦于 **Go 语言特有的并发设计模式与工程实践**。它与同目录下的兄弟 hub 形成互补关系：\n\n- **[并发模型](../14_concurrency-models/_INTRODUCTION.md)**：讲授跨语言的并发理论基础（CSP、Actor、共享内存、STM），是本 hub 的理论前置。\n- **[Go 服务工程](../16_go-service-engineering/_INTRODUCTION.md)**：关注 Go 项目的工程结构、错误处理与上线运维，本 hub 产出的并发模块正是在那套结构中运行。\n- **[Rust 系统编程](../74_rust-systems-programming/_INTRODUCTION.md)**：Rust 以所有权与类型系统在编译期消灭数据竞争，与 Go 运行时调度 + channel 方案形成对照。\n\n## 推荐学习路径\n\n**路径 A（系统化）**：从第一章顺序读到第四章——先夯实 goroutine 调度与 channel 语义基础，再逐步深入模式与高级技巧，最后落地到生产实践。\n\n**路径 B（问题驱动）**：已有 Go 并发经验的开发者可直接跳到第二章（Pipeline/Fan-Out/Worker Pool）或第三章（泄漏防治/iter 迭代器/sync 包演进），按需查阅。\n\n## 前置知识\n\n- 熟悉 Go 语法基础（函数、结构体、接口、defer）\n- 理解操作系统进程/线程概念\n- 了解 channel 与 goroutine 的基本用法（`go func()`、`<-ch`）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"并发基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gmp-scheduler","title":"GMP 调度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations/gmp-scheduler"},{"seq":2,"slug":"channel-internals","title":"Channel 语义与内部结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations/channel-internals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"select-multiplexing","title":"Select 多路复用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/foundations/select-multiplexing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"patterns","title":"经典并发模式","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline","title":"Pipeline 流水线模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/pipeline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fan-out-fan-in","title":"Fan-Out/Fan-In 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/fan-out-fan-in"},{"seq":3,"slug":"worker-pool","title":"Worker Pool 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/patterns/worker-pool"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶技巧","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"goroutine-leak-prevention","title":"Goroutine 泄漏防治","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/goroutine-leak-prevention"},{"seq":2,"slug":"iter-range-over-func","title":"iter 迭代器与 Range-Over-Func","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/iter-range-over-func"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sync-package-evolution","title":"sync 包演进与泛型化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/advanced/sync-package-evolution"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-concurrency","title":"结构化并发与 errgroup","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/structured-concurrency"},{"seq":2,"slug":"race-detection-profiling","title":"竞态检测与性能诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/race-detection-profiling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrent-service-checklist","title":"并发服务设计清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/concurrent-service-checklist"}]}]}